    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry Property Sales and Letting Agents are excited to present this fantastic 4 bedroom semi detached residence for sale. This 4 bedroom property is situated in the highly popular Sliabh Breagh area and located a short distance to the lovely village of Ardee. This accomodation which is not overlooked to the front or to the rear property is overlooking a large green area. This bright and spacious interior is situated in an excellent family friendly oriented area of Ardee making it an ideal choice for families or first time buyers. This is an opportunity not to be missed. Sliabh Breagh is located c.1.5km from Ardee Town Centre – which is just over 5 minutes away. Ardee is also a very popular commuter town due to its excellent transport links. The property enjoys convenient access to both the N2 and M1 Motorways offering excellent connectivity for your daily commute.  In Ardee, you will find all amenities close by including crèches, primary schools, secondary schools, shops, restaurants, pubs, sporting facilities, churches and bus routes. This property would be ideal for a first time buyer or families.\r\n\r\nExtra Features:\r\n\r\n\tExcellent location \r\n\tBright and spacious living accommodation\r\n\tBeautifully decorated and beautifully presented\r\n\tNot overlooked to front or rear of property\r\n\tGreen area to front of property\r\n\tCar parking facilities\r\n\tGarden to front of property and walled and hedged lined garden to rear of property\r\n\tOil fired Central Heating\r\n\tClose to all local amenities\r\n\tOnly minutes from Ardee town centre\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n\r\nDublin Airport: \t44 minutes via the M1 motorway\r\n\r\nDundalk:\t\t29 minutes via the M1 motorway\r\n\r\nDrogheda:\t\t24 minutes via the M1 motorway\r\n\r\nBelfast:\t\t        1hr 18 minutes via the M1 motorway"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation briefly comprises ground floor: entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, bedroom with en-suite and downstairs WC. Upstairs comprises of 3 bedrooms and family bathroom. This property is heated by Oil Fired Central Heating. This property also comes with car parking facilities. There is garden to the front of the property and walled and hedge lined garden to the rear of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent location\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation\r\nNot overlooked to front or rear of the property\r\nOverlooking green area\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nGardens to front of property and walled and hedge lined gardens to rear of property\r\nDriveway with Ample Car Parking Facilities\r\nClose to all local amenities\r\nJust minutes from Ardee Town Centre"
      },
